docs(changelog): group Unreleased Added entries into subsections

Organise the long flat Added list under five thematic subsections
(LLM & AI-agent mocking; LLM resilience, validation & cost testing;
HTTP chaos & protocol contract testing; Observability & dashboard;
Templating & runtime) for readability. All 20 entries preserved verbatim,
none added or removed; Changed left flat (only four, tightly coupled).

docs(website): close remaining audit gaps in consumer docs

Document the dashboard Verification and AsyncAPI views (mockserver_ui);
add the create_expectation chaos parameter to the MCP tool reference;
correct asyncapi_messaging to note the broker state is now visible in the
dashboard Async view; soften the OpenAPI 3.1 support wording; mark the
performance benchmarks as historical (Java 13) and config-dependent;
expand llms.txt coverage (+23 pages) for AI discoverability; replace the
dead Gitter link with GitHub Discussions; template the hardcoded
SwaggerHub API versions to {{ site.mockserver_api_version }}.
